+/**
+ * @file
+ * TGSI to LLVM IR translation -- SoA.
+ *
+ * @author Jose Fonseca <jfonseca@vmware.com>
+ *
+ * Based on tgsi_sse2.c code written by Michal Krol, Keith Whitwell,
+ * Brian Paul, and others.
