+/**
+ * Convert 2D texture coordinates of 4 vertices into cubemap coordinates
+ * in the given face.
+ * Coordinates must be in the range [0,1].
+ *
+ * \param face          Cubemap face.
+ * \param in_st         4 pairs of 2D texture coordinates to convert.
